{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"file_impact":[{"path":"AGENTS.md","reason":"the 'Bound every background process you spawn' section: its primary bound (timeout) does not exist on macOS and returns 127 so the command silently never runs, and its trap 'kill 0' sweep is described as reaping the entire process group without stating the scope at which that holds -- a wrapper spawned from a subshell survived it"}]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"FILE_IMPACT","timestamp":1788528642257801001,"uuid":"84268d8d-e9a6-4a7a-961b-b6d1b5764623"}